; nothing. This drives it: the two limits are set to 1, which makes every
; check-sat past the first eligible for relief. What authorizes the rotation
; must not depend on whichever clause trace one SAT backend's search happens
; to produce, so the file forces the SEMANTIC side structurally: twelve fat,
; fully distinct levels are pushed, solved and popped, and every popped
; snapshot stays retained by the caches while the final solve's live union
; is the tiny base level. Equalities, multiplies and comparisons are
; abstracted all along the way.
